# One source, a language model, and a paragraph that cites the rows it summarises.
Output public/gifs/summarise.gif
Set Height 620
Source tapes/_setup.tape

Type 'mosaic search "hall thruster anomalous electron transport" --source arxiv --max 6 --summarise'
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Hide
Wait@1200s
Sleep 1s
Show
Sleep 10s
